### Login Basic User
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "basic@demo.com",
  "password": "ShopSmart123!"
}

### Login Admin User
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@demo.com",
  "password": "ShopSmart123!"
}

### Q1: Can I return a laptop after 25 days?
POST http://localhost:5000/api/assistant/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Can I return a laptop after 25 days?"
}

### Q2: What is the return window for a gaming laptop?
POST http://localhost:5000/api/assistant/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the return window for a gaming laptop?"
}

