### Out-of-scope question
POST http://localhost:5000/api/assistant/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How do I bake a chocolate cake?"
}

### Near-miss question
POST http://localhost:5000/api/assistant/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Do you sell desktop computers?"
}

### Empty question (400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/assistant/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": ""
}

### No token (401)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/assistant/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Do I pay for return shipping?"
}

### View AI Logs (Admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/aiLogs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
